## Code Development, Debugging & Integration

Used IBM Bob as a development assistant to generate and refactor code, identify implementation issues, debug errors, and integrate the computer-vision, AI, Blender, backend, and frontend components.

**What Bob helped with:**

- Generating and refactoring service files (`mesh_service.py`, `ai_service.py`, `image_service.py`)
- Debugging the Next.js proxy 30-second timeout issue and designing the direct-fetch workaround in `api.ts`
- Fixing Windows `cp1252` encoding errors in `blender_pipeline.py` through UTF-8 stdout/stderr reconfiguration
- Integrating the Zustand `getBobContext()` selector so the chatbot always has fresh user state
- Resolving CORS configuration between the Next.js development server and the FastAPI backend
- Writing and validating the `generate_procedural_garment_glb()` GLTF binary packer using Python `struct`

---

> **IBM Bob was used across every layer of StitchSmart — not as a single-use coding tool, but as an active development and design collaborator spanning architecture, AI workflows, 3D/2D generation, debugging, and integration.**
